events.body:
I see that you have conceptual support from Pieter, Sanket, and Andrew, but it seems like at least Pieter’s PR is not yet merged. I also see that Andrew said the markdown changes look good to him.
@guggero: What’s your read on the situation, should this BIP update wait until the implementation updates have landed to ensure the BIP update is solid, or could it go in independently?

If the former, perhaps we could turn this into a draft until the relevant implementation PRs land. If the latter, could we perhaps get more obvious acceptance signals from the owners than Concept ACKs?
